---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site.js';

const lastUpdated = 'July 28, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Emergency Pools"
  description="How Emergency Pools collects, uses, and protects information from visitors to emergencypools.com."
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</em></p>

  <p>
    This policy explains what information {SITE.name} collects when you visit {SITE.domain},
    how it is used, and the choices you have. By using this site, you agree to the practices
    described below.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We do not require you to create an account or submit a form to browse this site. The
    information we collect falls into two categories:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Information you give us directly.</strong> If you call the number listed on this
      site, we receive your phone number and whatever details you share with our team to
      schedule service. We do not collect payment information through this website.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, we use cookies
      and similar tracking technologies to understand how visitors use the site — which pages
      are viewed, how long visitors stay, and whether a visit leads to a phone call. This is
      described in more detail below.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses Google Tag Manager to run the following tools. None of them collect your
    name, email, or payment details through this website — they track browsing behavior tied to
    your device or browser, not your identity.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Google Analytics (GA4).</strong> Measures page views, time on site, and which
      pages visitors leave from, so we can find and fix parts of the site that aren&rsquo;t
      working for visitors. See{' '}
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Google&rsquo;s Privacy Policy
      </a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Google Ads.</strong> If you&rsquo;ve visited this site, you may later see ads from
      {SITE.name} on other websites or in Google search results. You can control ad
      personalization at{' '}
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Google Ads Settings
      </a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Meta Pixel (Facebook/Instagram).</strong> Similarly, this may show you ads from
      {SITE.name} on Facebook or Instagram after you visit this site. You can control this at{' '}
      <a
        href="https://www.facebook.com/adpreferences"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Meta Ad Preferences
      </a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Microsoft Clarity.</strong> Records anonymized session behavior (scrolling,
      clicks) and heatmaps so we can see which parts of a page get attention and which get
      skipped. See{' '}
      <a
        href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Microsoft&rsquo;s Privacy Statement
      </a>.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies at any time through your browser settings. Doing so may
    affect how parts of the site function, but the site will remain usable.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use this information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To understand which pages and service areas visitors are interested in</li>
    <li>To find pages where visitors get stuck or leave without calling</li>
    <li>To show relevant ads to past visitors who haven&rsquo;t yet called for service</li>
    <li>To respond to service calls and schedule appointments</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell visitor information to third parties.</p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    Analytics and advertising data is retained according to each provider&rsquo;s standard
    retention settings (typically 14&ndash;26 months for Google Analytics). Information shared
    when you call us is kept only as long as needed to provide service and for basic business
    recordkeeping.
  </p>

  <h2>Children&rsquo;s privacy</h2>
  <p>
    This site is intended for adults seeking pool service and is not directed at children. We
    do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 13.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as our tools or practices change. The &ldquo;last updated&rdquo;
    date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent revision.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy or your information? Call {SITE.name} at{' '}
    <a href={SITE.phoneHref}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
